Modifications made in this fork, relative to
flect41/lovelace-blind-card-enhanced 0.1.0:

  - Added a `motion` option giving covers a real direction of travel
    (rtl, ltr, center, down). The upstream card always moves the sheet
    downward; its `style` option only changes the decorative window drawn
    behind it.
  - Added horizontal geometry: track metrics measured across the width,
    sheet anchored to the parked edge, pointer tracking on the X axis.
  - Added a second sheet and a second drag handle so centre-opening
    curtains can be dragged from either side.
  - Added window backgrounds: double_window, triple_window, window_door.
  - Made the picture fluid (width:100% with a per-style max-width) instead
    of a fixed pixel width, which overflowed narrow dashboard columns.
  - Removed the pull cord; the sheet edge is the drag handle.
  - Hid the decorative centre handle nubs on the room visuals.
  - Button icons now follow the configured motion.
  - Renamed the custom element to `blinds-and-curtains-card`.
